## Settings 的 JSON Patch 化

重构 settings 存储时遇到一个问题，如果直接使用 简单的 diff 实现，会造成无法正常触发数据保存。一开始的实现如下：
```ts
import { isEqual, isObject, transform } from 'lodash-es';

function difference(object, base) {
    function changes(object, base) {
        return transform(object, (result, value, key) => {
            if (!isEqual(value, base[key])) {
                result[key] = (isObject(value) && isObject(base[key])) ? changes(value, base[key]) : value;
            }
        });
    }
    return changes(object, base);
}

// 使用方法
const settings = {
    theme: 'dark',
    notifications: {
        follow: true,
        alerts: false,
        unfollow: true
    },
    privacy: {
        search: false
    }
};

const defaultSettings = {
    theme: 'light',
    notifications: {
        follow: false,
        alerts: true,
        unfollow: false
    },
    privacy: {
        search: true
    }
};

const modifiedSettings = difference(settings, defaultSettings);
console.log(modifiedSettings);
```


